<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>
<div class="row mt-4">
  <div class="col-12 col-md-8 offset-md-2">
    <div class="card glass-card p-4 p-md-5 rounded-4">
      <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved me-2" style="color: var(--accent-terracotta);"></i>Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p class="text-muted small">Last updated: September 2026</p>
      <hr style="border-color: var(--border-glass);">
      <h5 class="fw-bold mt-3">1. Information We Collect</h5>
      <p>Stayora collects minimal necessary account information, such as your username and email address, to facilitate property listings, reviews, and bookings.</p>
      <h5 class="fw-bold mt-3">2. How We Protect Your Data</h5>
      <p>Passwords are securely hashed and salted using PBKDF2 cryptography with Passport.js. We never store plain-text passwords or sensitive payment card numbers.</p>
      <h5 class="fw-bold mt-3">3. Cookies & Sessions</h5>
      <p>We use HTTP-only session cookies to maintain your login status and protect against session hijacking.</p>
      <a href="/listings" class="btn btn-glass mt-3 rounded-pill px-4 align-self-start">Back to Retreats</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
